OL,3,GNEWSADeath of pony in 'blind panic'
OL,4,Asparks dog warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said, while pony deaths in road
OL,7,Faccidents were a constant worry for
OL,8,Fcommoners, dogs were also becoming a
OL,9,F"massive issue".
